WEBVTT

00:07.230 --> 00:09.190
Let's finalize the contract.

00:09.190 --> 00:10.330
συμβόλαιο

00:19.610 --> 00:22.280
With this, the contract is finalized.

00:22.280 --> 00:23.260
Yes.

00:23.860 --> 00:28.030
I will do the rest at my own discretion.

00:28.610 --> 00:30.250
Please do.

00:30.610 --> 00:34.490
Your daughter is safe with me.

00:49.760 --> 00:53.500
It seems you aren't named 
the Glutton for nothing.

00:54.360 --> 00:55.800
I suppose.

00:58.070 --> 00:59.820
I'll take that brain.

01:05.460 --> 01:07.530
Oh, gross.

01:07.530 --> 01:09.450
So who is this anyway?

01:09.450 --> 01:12.010
Probably an assassin from 
an opposing sub-faction.

01:12.010 --> 01:15.760
So not even Eugenics is a monolith.

01:15.760 --> 01:20.090
Yes. Our own organization is quite 
convoluted in that respect.

01:20.480 --> 01:23.310
Therefore, I must acquire that 
vessel as soon as possible,

01:23.310 --> 01:26.660
so that I may reach even greater heights.

01:26.660 --> 01:28.280
Vessel, huh?

01:28.280 --> 01:30.570
Is it really that girl though?

01:30.570 --> 01:32.010
It is.

01:32.010 --> 01:33.840
I am absolutely certain.

01:33.840 --> 01:36.910
The Magic Chevalier just 
confirmed it for me.

01:36.910 --> 01:38.850
She is definitely the vessel.

01:39.830 --> 01:43.500
Well, as long as I can earn money 
and feed, it is all the same to me.

01:44.800 --> 01:47.710
The time for our revenge is finally upon us.

01:48.490 --> 01:52.760
Yes, and I only need Rebecca Bradley for it.

02:21.990 --> 02:25.740
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

03:24.760 --> 03:27.970
<b>Episode 10
The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Sets Up a Maid Cafe</b>

03:34.330 --> 03:36.540
Good morning, Miss Rebecca.

03:38.040 --> 03:39.200
Ray.

03:42.010 --> 03:43.850
Good morning.

03:47.930 --> 03:51.650
So you've... heard. Haven't you?

03:51.650 --> 03:54.180
I have. Congratulations.

03:55.420 --> 03:57.120
Thank you.

03:57.550 --> 04:01.610
I'll still be coming to the 
academy until I graduate.

04:01.610 --> 04:03.140
I'm glad to hear that.

04:03.140 --> 04:05.480
The academy wouldn't be 
the same without you.

04:05.480 --> 04:06.340
I'm happy.

04:09.450 --> 04:11.150
Miss Rebecca?

04:11.150 --> 04:13.550
It's nothing.

04:13.550 --> 04:16.310
Once again, I look forward 
to working with you.

04:16.310 --> 04:16.740
Likewise!

04:26.920 --> 04:27.740
What do you think?

04:27.740 --> 04:28.900
Can you do it?

04:29.810 --> 04:34.730
If we start from scratch it'll 
be hard to get them all done in time...

04:34.730 --> 04:37.250
But maybe if we start with off-the-shelf items...

04:37.250 --> 04:38.500
Then you can do it!

04:38.500 --> 04:40.860
It would be hard to do it all by myself,

04:40.860 --> 04:43.660
but I think we could
it if other people helped.

04:43.660 --> 04:45.950
That's wonderful, Elisa!

04:46.410 --> 04:49.190
You're going to wear it, too, right?

04:49.190 --> 04:50.320
Wha? Me, too?

04:50.320 --> 04:51.840
Obviously!

04:51.840 --> 04:52.990
Take a good look!

04:52.990 --> 04:56.450
There's no world where it would be okay for 
you to not wear something this cute.

04:56.450 --> 04:58.890
But... But... 
B-B-B-But wait a minute!

04:58.890 --> 05:02.510
But this outfit shows quite a bit of leg,

05:02.510 --> 05:06.250
and the chest area is more 
than a little bit prominent!

05:06.250 --> 05:08.490
I-It's too embarrassing!

05:08.490 --> 05:10.690
You'll be fine. I'm going to wear it, too!

05:10.690 --> 05:13.020
That doesn't help me!

05:14.100 --> 05:17.030
Elisa, I can't wait.

05:18.740 --> 05:22.360
Ray, Amelia's being weird!

05:22.360 --> 05:24.190
Do something.

05:24.190 --> 05:28.200
Elisa, I am also interested 
in your lovely form.

05:28.750 --> 05:32.960
You are far more beautiful 
and cute than you know.

05:32.960 --> 05:34.380
I will vouch for that.

05:34.890 --> 05:37.390
So please, won't you wear it, too?

05:39.460 --> 05:40.340
Elisa...

05:41.270 --> 05:42.390
Won't you?

05:45.380 --> 05:47.370
F-Fine!

05:47.370 --> 05:49.730
If you insist like that!

05:50.240 --> 05:51.430
I'll do it.

05:52.080 --> 05:53.320
Thank you, Elisa!

05:53.320 --> 05:54.590
Rose Kick!

05:55.570 --> 05:57.280
Amelia, that hurt.

05:57.920 --> 05:58.830
Whatever!

05:58.830 --> 05:59.660
Whatever!

05:59.660 --> 06:00.600
I mean, I already knew.

06:00.600 --> 06:02.430
I already knew, but still!

06:10.250 --> 06:12.340
Put that a little more to the right.

06:12.340 --> 06:14.110
Rotate fifteen degrees.

06:14.110 --> 06:17.250
No! Counter-clockwise!

06:18.530 --> 06:19.810
White!

06:19.810 --> 06:21.820
What do you think so far?

06:21.820 --> 06:23.850
It's better than I ever imagined.

06:23.850 --> 06:26.570
I can't believe you've made 
this much progress already.

06:27.200 --> 06:29.170
Everybody's super motivated!

06:29.170 --> 06:30.160
Really?

06:30.160 --> 06:30.880
Yeah!

06:30.880 --> 06:33.660
Lads, let's make this one a success, eh?!

06:33.660 --> 06:35.270
Let's go!

06:35.270 --> 06:36.400
Let's do it!

06:36.280 --> 06:38.130
Your words,

06:36.400 --> 06:37.920
We've got this!

06:38.130 --> 06:39.420
your passion,

06:39.420 --> 06:41.580
it all resonated in our hearts.

06:41.580 --> 06:42.650
Albert?

06:42.650 --> 06:43.870
It's true.

06:43.870 --> 06:48.250
When I first got here, I would have 
never imagined a scene like this.

06:49.000 --> 06:50.250
Everyone...

06:50.550 --> 06:53.250
So how's... that angle coming along?

06:53.250 --> 06:55.190
It's perfect.

06:55.190 --> 06:56.940
Elisa agreed, too.

06:56.940 --> 06:57.990
Really?!

06:56.940 --> 06:59.110
Oh, yeah!

06:58.440 --> 07:01.050
Even the shy Elisa?!

06:59.110 --> 07:01.290
Come on lads, let's do this!

07:02.770 --> 07:04.760
What's happening?

07:04.760 --> 07:08.890
Once again, your actions 
have united everyone.

07:08.890 --> 07:09.570
Ray.

07:10.640 --> 07:15.840
It means there isn't a man on this 
earth who doesn't like maid outfits.

07:19.650 --> 07:21.570
A maid cafe?

07:21.570 --> 07:22.460
Yes.

07:22.460 --> 07:25.880
Well, I don't think there's a 
problem with the idea itself,

07:25.880 --> 07:28.990
but I'm surprised all the 
noble students agreed to it.

07:28.990 --> 07:30.180
Miss Sera.

07:31.260 --> 07:35.110
There isn't a person on this earth 
who doesn't like maid outfits.

07:35.110 --> 07:36.610
What?

07:36.610 --> 07:38.240
Fine, whatever.

07:38.240 --> 07:41.450
The paperwork is all in order, 
so consider it filed.

07:41.450 --> 07:42.720
You can go back now.

07:43.150 --> 07:45.460
May I ask you a question?

07:45.460 --> 07:46.680
Yes?

07:47.370 --> 07:50.060
Where is the rest of the student council?

07:51.610 --> 07:54.790
I don't know if you're just 
too eagle-eyed or what...

07:54.790 --> 07:56.070
Miss Rebecca?

07:56.070 --> 07:57.170
I think we could tell Ray...

07:59.790 --> 08:02.300
The other members are no longer coming.

08:02.300 --> 08:03.830
Why would they not?

08:04.450 --> 08:07.170
It's because of my engagement.

08:07.170 --> 08:08.790
And why would that be?

08:08.790 --> 08:11.550
The secretary of the 
student council, Cornea...

08:11.550 --> 08:15.900
Apparently, she was originally slated 
to be engaged to Lord Evan.

08:15.900 --> 08:17.680
Lord Evan?

08:18.100 --> 08:19.910
Evan Bernstein.

08:19.910 --> 08:21.600
He is my fiancé.

08:22.170 --> 08:28.980
So what that means is that 
I've stolen Cornea's fiancé.

08:29.230 --> 08:33.600
The others have aligned with her 
and are boycotting the meetings.

08:33.600 --> 08:38.970
Which is why now Dina and I are the only 
ones left to do the student council work.

08:38.970 --> 08:40.720
So that's what happened.

08:41.750 --> 08:43.140
I understand.

08:43.140 --> 08:45.370
Please allow me to help!

08:45.370 --> 08:47.500
I figured you would say that.

08:47.500 --> 08:51.470
But don't you have your own 
class's event to help with?

08:51.700 --> 08:55.950
Ever since I've come to this academy, 
both of you have been immensely helpful to me.

08:55.950 --> 08:58.940
Not just with the gardening club 
and the Magic Chevalier...

08:58.940 --> 09:01.360
so please let me repay 
that favor now.

09:01.360 --> 09:04.470
I want to help you two, any way that I can!

09:05.360 --> 09:06.560
Ray...

09:07.010 --> 09:08.580
Jeez, Ray.

09:09.470 --> 09:11.480
Then, let's accept his help, Rebecca.

09:11.480 --> 09:13.090
With him on board, I'm sure we can...

09:14.250 --> 09:15.450
Miss Rebecca.

09:17.280 --> 09:18.730
All right.

09:18.730 --> 09:22.130
Ray, we will count on you, then.

09:22.930 --> 09:23.800
Of course!

09:27.180 --> 09:29.010
Ray, do you have a moment?

09:29.010 --> 09:30.550
Yes, what is it?

09:32.390 --> 09:34.350
I have a favor to ask of you.

09:34.350 --> 09:35.450
Sure.

09:35.450 --> 09:38.060
You should ask what it is first.

09:38.320 --> 09:42.520
There is nothing you could ask 
of me that I would refuse.

09:44.090 --> 09:45.480
There you go again.

09:46.210 --> 09:50.280
I think there's something going 
on with Rebecca's engagement.

09:50.280 --> 09:52.160
What do you mean?

09:52.160 --> 09:54.780
Nobody heard even a whisper 
about this before,

09:54.780 --> 09:56.790
and then suddenly it happened.

09:57.220 --> 10:00.220
Not to mention, House Bradley is 
one of the top three noble houses.

10:00.220 --> 10:03.050
If you pause to think about it, 
this is completely unthinkable.

10:03.490 --> 10:04.880
I see.

10:04.880 --> 10:08.350
There must be something to Evan Bernstein.

10:08.350 --> 10:12.000
Miss Rebecca won't tell me anything, though.

10:12.000 --> 10:15.020
I'm sure she's trying to protect me 
from getting mixed up in something.

10:15.400 --> 10:19.500
Which is exactly why I can't get 
any closer to her on this topic.

10:19.860 --> 10:22.020
But I'm sure you could.

10:22.650 --> 10:23.550
Please.

10:23.550 --> 10:25.310
Stay close to Miss Rebecca.

10:26.190 --> 10:27.180
Certainly.

10:28.020 --> 10:29.400
You can count on me.

10:29.890 --> 10:31.850
Thank you, Ray.

10:39.410 --> 10:42.060
Master, I apologize for such a late visit.

10:42.060 --> 10:43.150
It's fine.

10:43.150 --> 10:45.950
But you don't often show up out of the blue.

10:45.950 --> 10:47.190
Did something happen?

10:47.190 --> 10:47.750
Yes.

10:48.030 --> 10:51.040
About the House Bradley engagement...

10:54.170 --> 10:56.330
Evan Bernstein...

10:56.960 --> 10:58.620
Do you know anything, Carla?

10:59.180 --> 11:02.000
House Bernstein is a family 
in the upper echelons.

11:02.000 --> 11:06.170
Their standing and sorcery prowess 
leaves nothing to be desired,

11:06.170 --> 11:08.430
even for the top three houses.

11:08.860 --> 11:10.240
I see.

11:10.240 --> 11:13.510
So there's nothing strange about 
Miss Rebecca's engagement here.

11:13.820 --> 11:17.910
Still, considering Rebecca's age,

11:17.910 --> 11:20.630
this engagement does seem rushed.

11:20.630 --> 11:22.640
It's natural to think that.

11:22.640 --> 11:24.570
Carla, would you mind?

11:24.570 --> 11:26.020
I'll need about a week.

11:26.330 --> 11:27.840
Then, please.

11:27.840 --> 11:29.290
Understood.

11:29.290 --> 11:30.400
Please do.

11:31.100 --> 11:34.140
By the way Ray, what are you 
doing for the cultural festival?

11:34.690 --> 11:35.910
We're doing a maid cafe.

11:36.210 --> 11:37.430
A maid cafe?

11:37.780 --> 11:39.910
So, a cafe with maids?

11:39.910 --> 11:41.740
What is that good for?

11:41.740 --> 11:47.930
Master, there isn't a life form on this 
earth that doesn't like maid outfits.

11:48.910 --> 11:49.990
Hmm.

11:49.990 --> 11:52.950
So that means you like them, as well?

11:52.950 --> 11:54.110
Yes.

11:54.110 --> 11:56.930
I like Miss Carla's maid outfit, too.

11:56.930 --> 11:58.220
What?!

11:58.220 --> 12:00.940
Master Ray, please.

12:00.940 --> 12:05.280
Actually, when Amelia first approached 
me with the idea of the maid cafe,

12:05.280 --> 12:09.570
the very first thing that came to mind 
was a beautiful vision of Miss Carla.

12:10.470 --> 12:11.990
Ray, oh you...

12:12.510 --> 12:15.980
I realized there's something 
tangibly attractive to maid outfits...

12:16.480 --> 12:17.450
that grabs your heart.

12:17.450 --> 12:18.850
You mustn't...

12:18.850 --> 12:20.260
Ray! Don't rush to conclusions!

12:20.260 --> 12:21.760
That's just deception!

12:23.330 --> 12:25.770
If I were to put on a maid outfit,

12:25.770 --> 12:27.710
wouldn't the effects be amazing?

12:27.710 --> 12:30.060
Welcome home!

12:31.920 --> 12:33.750
You, in a maid outfit, Master?

12:33.750 --> 12:35.710
That's a good joke!

12:35.710 --> 12:37.630
A gorilla can't be a maid!

12:39.720 --> 12:42.310
Huh? You want to die?

12:43.440 --> 12:46.380
My deepest apologies for the disrespect.

12:46.380 --> 12:47.290
It's settled.

12:48.270 --> 12:51.070
Carla and I will be there for 
the cultural festival, as well.

12:51.590 --> 12:53.090
Looking forward to it.

12:53.090 --> 12:53.870
Wonderful!

12:53.870 --> 12:55.180
I am overjoyed and grateful!

13:22.410 --> 13:24.330
That dream again.

13:25.530 --> 13:27.110
Why is Ray...

13:39.960 --> 13:41.130
Why?

13:43.030 --> 13:44.250
Hello?

13:45.030 --> 13:46.080
Maria!

13:46.530 --> 13:48.380
What are you doing here at this hour?

13:48.380 --> 13:52.810
I got sweaty, so I took a shower.

13:52.810 --> 13:55.330
Isn't that blood?

13:55.330 --> 14:00.200
Um, I got a little nosebleed.

14:00.820 --> 14:02.470
Maybe I got too hot.

14:03.800 --> 14:06.270
That's unusual for you.

14:06.870 --> 14:08.390
It's late.

14:08.390 --> 14:10.170
You should to go to bed, too.

14:10.780 --> 14:11.500
Are you all right?

14:11.800 --> 14:13.200
With the engagement...?

14:15.650 --> 14:17.430
It's fine.

14:18.300 --> 14:21.360
I am the eldest daughter of one 
of the three great houses.

14:23.680 --> 14:26.500
I hope you'll actually have love.

14:28.060 --> 14:29.510
Hey, wait!

14:53.030 --> 14:54.270
Look at that kid.

14:54.270 --> 14:56.540
They're so creepy.

14:56.540 --> 14:58.540
Like, all white.

14:58.540 --> 14:59.750
So weird!

14:59.750 --> 15:01.180
Right?

15:02.180 --> 15:05.700
Big sister, am I weird?

15:05.700 --> 15:07.500
Not at all!

15:07.500 --> 15:09.860
You're very cute.

15:09.860 --> 15:11.510
Really?

15:11.510 --> 15:12.360
That's right!

15:12.360 --> 15:15.620
Your white skin and hair.

15:15.620 --> 15:18.540
And then, your red eyes.

15:18.540 --> 15:19.600
You're very pretty.

15:20.000 --> 15:22.440
It doesn't matter what anyone says.

15:22.440 --> 15:27.160
I think you're very adorable.

15:32.980 --> 15:35.640
Maria, what have you done to yourself?!

15:35.640 --> 15:38.540
That is not how a daughter of one of 
the three great houses should look!

15:38.540 --> 15:39.960
Take a leaf out of Rebecca's book!

15:40.420 --> 15:42.560
My sister is so wonderful.

15:43.130 --> 15:45.080
So elegant and pretty.

15:45.080 --> 15:48.290
Your pride and joy who you 
can show around anywhere,

15:48.290 --> 15:49.970
with good grades to boot.

15:49.970 --> 15:53.350
Just leave me alone and let me be a failure!

15:53.590 --> 15:54.220
Maria!

15:55.510 --> 15:57.830
<i>Why do I have to look like this?</i>

15:57.830 --> 16:00.230
<i>Why do I not have any talent?</i>

16:00.500 --> 16:03.280
<i>Why can I not be like my sister?</i>

16:04.920 --> 16:06.790
I heard it from Father.

16:06.790 --> 16:09.140
What is the story behind this engagement?

16:12.570 --> 16:14.520
I knew something was going on!

16:15.150 --> 16:17.040
It's none of your business.

16:17.040 --> 16:18.600
Why are you hiding it?

16:18.600 --> 16:21.850
You wouldn't be looking so sad if 
it was an ordinary engagement!

16:21.850 --> 16:22.760
Go home.

16:59.830 --> 17:01.800
Now that's something.

17:01.800 --> 17:04.040
I can really feel the 
cultural festival vibe now!

17:04.040 --> 17:05.370
Yeah, I'm excited.

17:12.890 --> 17:14.340
You look wonderful, Wanda!

17:14.340 --> 17:15.920
R-Really?

17:15.920 --> 17:18.460
I was skeptical, at first, but not anymore.

17:18.460 --> 17:20.530
Maid outfits are so great.

17:20.530 --> 17:21.720
Indeed.

17:21.720 --> 17:23.180
You all look beautiful.

17:23.770 --> 17:25.260
White?

17:25.260 --> 17:26.980
Those dresses really suit you.

17:26.980 --> 17:27.840
Oh, come on.

17:27.840 --> 17:28.680
You're exaggerating!

17:28.680 --> 17:29.670
Jeez.

17:29.670 --> 17:30.810
Ray.

17:35.350 --> 17:36.460
What do you think?

17:36.890 --> 17:37.860
Wow!

17:36.890 --> 17:39.230
Wow, it's spectacular!

17:37.860 --> 17:39.230
Beautiful!

17:39.500 --> 17:43.390
The maid outfit accentuates 
your beauty even more.

17:40.310 --> 17:41.580
Gorgeous!

17:44.020 --> 17:45.250
Well, thanks!

17:45.620 --> 17:48.760
Oh, and don't you think Elisa 
looks really cute, too?

17:51.210 --> 17:54.660
I-Is this all right?

17:55.390 --> 17:57.150
Elisa, it's splendid!

17:57.150 --> 17:58.810
Even better than I could have ever imagined.

17:58.810 --> 18:00.390
It looks very cute.

18:00.390 --> 18:02.380
Th-Thank you.

18:02.380 --> 18:04.340
I guess it's good that I put it on.

18:04.340 --> 18:06.650
It really is.

18:06.650 --> 18:08.320
Rose Punch!

18:08.320 --> 18:10.330
Amelia, that hurts.

18:10.330 --> 18:11.620
I mean, I already knew!

18:11.620 --> 18:13.080
I already knew, but still!

18:13.080 --> 18:14.970
Damn you, Ray!

18:17.620 --> 18:19.650
And the thing with the student council!

18:19.650 --> 18:21.270
You realized?

18:21.270 --> 18:22.870
Of course I did.

18:23.150 --> 18:26.980
As if you could leave Rebecca hanging.

18:26.980 --> 18:28.730
You got me there.

18:28.730 --> 18:31.940
Well, that's what's good about you, 
so it can't be helped, but...

18:31.940 --> 18:33.960
It can't be helped, but...

18:34.420 --> 18:35.730
Rose Magnum!

18:35.730 --> 18:37.360
Amelia, that hurts.

18:37.360 --> 18:38.580
Shut up!

18:38.950 --> 18:40.820
So cute.

18:40.820 --> 18:41.550
Claris?

18:41.550 --> 18:43.670
I'm jealous of your maid cafe.

18:43.670 --> 18:45.550
What's with the outfit?

18:45.820 --> 18:49.550
Our class is doing a haunted mansion.

18:49.550 --> 18:51.260
It looks cute!

18:51.530 --> 18:54.860
It's supposed to be what some foreign 
country's ghosts look like.

18:54.860 --> 18:57.320
It does suit you quite well. Very cute.

18:57.320 --> 18:59.690
I'm not sure how I feel 
about being called cute

18:59.690 --> 19:01.380
when I'm supposed to be a 
ghost, but I'll take it.

19:01.380 --> 19:02.180
Thanks.

19:02.180 --> 19:05.280
Claris, I love your foreign costume!

19:05.280 --> 19:06.740
Amelia, come on!

19:05.660 --> 19:07.710
Exotic is the best!

19:08.030 --> 19:10.720
<i>This is already pretty high level.</i>

19:11.370 --> 19:13.320
<i>But we can push it one step further.</i>

19:12.600 --> 19:14.780
And the three hairs are cute, too!

19:14.780 --> 19:16.210
Amelia, stop!

19:17.180 --> 19:19.320
So how's Ray's class doing?

19:20.570 --> 19:22.820
It's got a very nice feeling.

19:22.820 --> 19:24.610
They're quite united,

19:24.610 --> 19:26.520
with Ray at the center of it all.

19:26.810 --> 19:28.000
I see.

19:28.000 --> 19:28.710
Yup!

19:29.910 --> 19:31.010
I see...

19:41.040 --> 19:42.570
Ray?

19:42.570 --> 19:45.650
I'll walk you home.

19:47.950 --> 19:50.640
So you're no longer using the dorms?

19:50.640 --> 19:51.540
Yes.

19:51.540 --> 19:54.050
I am engaged, after all.

19:54.050 --> 19:58.830
I think I'll be moving out of the dorms 
once the cultural festival is over.

19:58.830 --> 20:00.070
I see.

20:00.670 --> 20:03.090
The cultural festival is almost here.

20:03.090 --> 20:05.300
Are your preparations going well?

20:05.300 --> 20:06.360
Yes.

20:06.360 --> 20:10.220
The whole class coming together 
as one to achieve a common goal

20:10.220 --> 20:12.480
has been a really great experience.

20:12.480 --> 20:13.840
Oh, really?

20:13.840 --> 20:15.170
I can't wait to see it.

20:15.560 --> 20:16.690
Rebecca?

20:21.520 --> 20:23.060
Lord Evan...

20:24.950 --> 20:27.630
You walked my fiancée home?

20:29.110 --> 20:30.700
I'm Ray White.

20:30.700 --> 20:32.600
Evan Bernstein.

20:33.310 --> 20:35.250
It's an honor to meet you.

20:35.250 --> 20:36.580
The honor is mine.

20:37.100 --> 20:38.540
Well, then, Mr. White.

20:39.240 --> 20:42.120
I'll accompany her myself from here.

20:42.520 --> 20:43.490
All right.

20:43.490 --> 20:45.410
Then, excuse me.

20:46.770 --> 20:48.520
Thank you very much.

20:48.940 --> 20:50.990
Let's go, Rebecca.

20:59.650 --> 21:02.940
There must be something to Evan Bernstein.

21:06.950 --> 21:08.020
Sir?

21:10.620 --> 21:15.340
There's no evidence of humans 
living in the Bernstein manor.

21:16.290 --> 21:19.110
No servants, let alone 
members of the household.

21:19.110 --> 21:22.730
It seems to have been completely 
abandoned for several years.

21:23.160 --> 21:26.610
But Evan Bernstein has been 
attending aristocratic gatherings

21:26.610 --> 21:29.510
and academic sorcery summits, right?

21:29.510 --> 21:30.190
Correct.

21:30.660 --> 21:35.020
It is likely that he has kept this 
deception running for a long time,

21:35.020 --> 21:37.870
as to avoid being found out by the 
kingdom or the Sorcerer Society.

21:37.870 --> 21:40.010
I see.

21:40.550 --> 21:43.060
I'm starting to get it.

21:43.060 --> 21:47.580
So he's after... 
Rebecca Bradley's sorcerer's eyes.

21:47.580 --> 21:49.080
That means...

21:49.490 --> 21:50.530
Indeed.

21:50.530 --> 21:53.960
It's most probable that Evan Bernstein

21:53.960 --> 21:57.560
is a collector of sorcerer's eyes 
and is involved with Eugenics.

22:01.690 --> 22:02.950
So how was it?

22:03.780 --> 22:05.580
We're almost there.

22:06.150 --> 22:10.110
Once Rebecca Bradley awakens as Kreuz...

22:10.110 --> 22:12.980
then the gate to Akasha will open.

22:14.810 --> 22:18.990
Liese, I promise you will...

23:49.940 --> 23:54.950
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

