This is the preview of the next episode of

23:52.020 --> 23:53.980
<i>The Iceblade Sorcerer 
Shall Rule the World!</i>

23:54.950 --> 23:57.200
The girl who sheds the tears of despair.

23:57.200 --> 24:00.330
The turbulent skies that envelope everything 
as if in concert with her heart.

24:00.330 --> 24:02.570
The beautiful lily goes into bloom.

24:02.570 --> 24:06.240
"The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest 
Sorcerer Resonates With the Past"!

24:05.460 --> 24:09.970
<b>Episode 11
The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Resonates with the Past</b>

